				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">Jean Imbert at Plaza Athénée.</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">A Michelin-Starred Ode to French Gastronomy.
Nestled within the legendary Hôtel Plaza Athénée in the heart of Paris, Jean Imbert’s eponymous Michelin-starred restaurant is a celebration of French haute cuisine. A master of reinvention, Imbert has taken the helm of this iconic dining destination, blending heritage with innovation to craft a gastronomic experience that is both timeless and contemporary.</p></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3ec2e251 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="3ec2e251" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
