					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">Banyan Tree Samui.</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Surrounded by lush tropical gardens, the resort offers an unparalleled escape into serenity, blending Thai heritage with world-class hospitality. Whether seeking a romantic retreat, a family getaway, or a personal wellness journey, Banyan Tree Samui promises an unforgettable experience.</p></div></div>				</div>
