				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">The Setai Miami Beach.</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Nestled along the pristine shores of South Beach, The Setai Miami Beach is an unparalleled sanctuary of luxury, elegance, and tranquility. A seamless fusion of Asian-inspired serenity and Art Deco grandeur, this five-star resort stands as a beacon of sophistication, offering an intimate retreat for discerning travelers seeking an elevated hospitality experience.</p></div></div>				</div>
