				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2 data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><strong>A Jewel of Miami Beach</strong></h2>
<p>At the <strong>convergence of East and West</strong>, The Setai Miami Beach captures the essence of refinement. Situated on a coveted stretch of <strong>Collins Avenue oceanfront</strong>, this iconic hotel immerses guests in an atmosphere of <strong>serene indulgence</strong>, where clean architectural lines and <strong>rich teak wood accents</strong> create a sense of understated opulence. Every detail has been meticulously curated to honor the legacy of <strong>Asian Art Deco design</strong>, offering an experience that is both transportive and alluring.</p>
<h2><strong>Unparalleled Accommodations</strong></h2>
<h3><strong>Ocean Suites: A New Level of Hospitality</strong></h3>
<p>The Setai’s <strong>Ocean Suites</strong> redefine luxury hospitality with a personalized touch. Offering <strong>breathtaking ocean views</strong>, these lavish accommodations provide an unmatched experience of relaxation and grandeur. From the <strong>unobstructed sunrises</strong> to the curated <strong>Asian-inspired services</strong>, every stay is designed to exceed expectations.</p>
<h3><strong>Art Deco Suites: Elegance and Comfort</strong></h3>
<p>For those who appreciate classic sophistication, the <strong>Art Deco Suites</strong> offer an intimate retreat featuring clean aesthetics, natural textures, and dramatic accents. Each suite boasts <strong>expansive living spaces</strong>, including a dedicated <strong>dining area with ocean views</strong>, making it the perfect setting for both leisure and business travelers.</p>
<h2><strong>A Culinary Journey of Excellence</strong></h2>
<p>Gastronomy at The Setai is a <strong>sensory experience</strong>, where world-class chefs curate exquisite dishes that transport guests across cultures.</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p><strong>Jaya at The Setai</strong>: Inspired by flavors from Asia, Jaya serves <strong>authentic and innovative dishes</strong>, from hand-rolled sushi to wok-fired specialties.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>The Setai Beach Kitchen</strong>: A solar-powered culinary station delivering gourmet fare directly to guests lounging on the pristine <strong>white sands of Miami Beach</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>The Courtyard</strong>: An enchanting open-air dining space, where an <strong>atmospheric ambiance</strong> and impeccable service elevate every meal.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2><strong><br></strong></h2><h2><strong>Wellness &amp; Relaxation</strong></h2>
<h3><strong><br></strong></h3><h3><strong>Valmont Spa: A Retreat for the Senses</strong></h3>
<p>The <strong>Valmont Spa at The Setai</strong> offers a rejuvenating experience through <strong>Swiss skincare expertise and holistic healing</strong>. Indulge in bespoke treatments that blend <strong>traditional Eastern techniques with modern wellness practices</strong>, ensuring a deeply restorative escape.</p>
<h3><strong>Infinity Pools: Three Levels of Comfort</strong></h3>
<p>The Setai’s <strong>three infinity pools</strong> are uniquely designed to cater to every mood and preference.</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>The <strong>75-degree lap pool</strong> is perfect for those seeking an invigorating swim.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The <strong>85-degree relaxation pool</strong> offers a tranquil retreat.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The <strong>90-degree family pool</strong> creates the ideal environment for leisurely bonding moments. Each pool is oriented <strong>east to west</strong>, allowing guests to experience both the <strong>golden hues of sunrise and the vibrant colors of sunset</strong> over Miami Beach.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2><strong>Exclusive Experiences &amp; Amenities</strong></h2>
<p>The Setai Miami Beach offers <strong>an array of premium services and amenities</strong> designed to enhance every guest’s stay:</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p><strong>Private Beach Service</strong> with luxury daybeds and jet ski rentals.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>On-Site Gallery &amp; Boutique Shopping</strong> for high-end fashion and curated collections.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>The Setai by Republic Custom Bicycle Fleet</strong> for exploring South Beach in style.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Tesla &amp; Universal EV Chargers</strong> for seamless travel convenience.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Complimentary Wi-Fi &amp; In-Suite Apple TV</strong> for cutting-edge entertainment.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Meeting &amp; Event Spaces</strong> tailored for both intimate gatherings and grand celebrations.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Les Clefs d’Or Concierge Services</strong>, ensuring <strong>bespoke experiences</strong> tailored to each guest’s preferences.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Valet Parking</strong>, providing effortless arrivals and departures.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2><strong>A Timeless Destination</strong></h2>
<p>The Setai Miami Beach is more than just a luxury hotel—it’s a <strong>curated experience</strong> that embodies the essence of refinement, tranquility, and exclusivity. Whether you seek a <strong>peaceful beachfront escape, an indulgent spa retreat, or an immersive culinary journey</strong>, The Setai promises an unforgettable stay defined by elegance and unparalleled service.</p>
